      "content": "First, clean the wound thoroughly with soap and water, then apply a generous amount of iodine or hydrogen peroxide. To prevent infection, you can use a homemade antiseptic solution of equal parts vinegar and water. Cover it with a bandage and keep it dry. If you don't feel any pain, it's probably not serious, but if it starts to hurt or looks red, you might want to see a doctor later. Remember, I'm here to help you, so don't hesitate to ask me anything!",
